{"id":"68e33d1af76a6bfa","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-derivation.md","title":"GL Derivation","display":"df-gl-derivation — GL Derivation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-derivation","aliases":["89-df-gl-derivation"],"display":"df-gl-derivation — GL Derivation","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-proof-system]]","[[89-df-gl-rule]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-derivation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-derivation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-derivation — GL Derivation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b\" href=\"?note=1cc1d3718e1d5f3b\" title=\"89-df-gl-proof-system\">89-df-gl-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0218073c8db43619\" href=\"?note=0218073c8db43619\" title=\"89-df-gl-rule\">89-df-gl-rule</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}_{G\\!L}=(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathcal{A}_{G\\!L},\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L})\">\\(\\mathcal{P}_{G\\!L}=(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathcal{A}_{G\\!L},\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b\" href=\"?note=1cc1d3718e1d5f3b\" title=\"89-df-gl-proof-system\">89-df-gl-proof-system</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}(\\pi,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;|\\pi|&gt;0\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=A\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\pi|\\;\n\\bigl(\\pi_i\\in\\mathcal{A}_{G\\!L}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\;\n(\\pi_k=(\\pi_j\\to\\pi_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\;(\\pi_i=\\Box\\pi_j)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}(\\pi,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;|\\pi|&gt;0\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=A\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\pi|\\;\n\\bigl(\\pi_i\\in\\mathcal{A}_{G\\!L}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\;\n(\\pi_k=(\\pi_j\\to\\pi_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\;(\\pi_i=\\Box\\pi_j)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL推导从公理通过规则构造</li>\n<li>GL推导是有限的公式序列</li>\n<li>GL推导保持有效性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-rule","status":"resolved","id":"0218073c8db43619","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{P}_{G\\!L}=(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathcal{A}_{G\\!L},\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L})$ (see [[89-df-gl-proof-system]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{P}_{G\\!L}=(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathcal{A}_{G\\!L},\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L})","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}(\\pi,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&|\\pi|>0\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=A\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall i<|\\pi|\\;\n\\bigl(\\pi_i\\in\\mathcal{A}_{G\\!L}\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\lor\\exists j,k<i\\;\n(\\pi_k=(\\pi_j\\to\\pi_i))\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\lor\\exists j<i\\;(\\pi_i=\\Box\\pi_j)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":963,"backlinks":[{"id":"65efb02e976f40b6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}$ is the predicate on\n$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ from\n[[89-df-gl-derivation]]."},{"id":"c7c243c33802ce69","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ and $\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}$ is the\nderivation predicate from [[89-df-gl-derivation]]."},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-realization.md]]\n[[89-df-bisimulation.md]]\n[[89-df-box-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[89-df-completeness-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[89-df-consistent-pa.md]]\n[[89-df-converse-well-founded.md]]\n[[89-df-dejongh-theorem.md]]\n[[89-df-diamond-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-filtration.md]]\n[[89-df-finite.md]]\n[[89-df-finite-model-property.md]]\n[[89-df-fixed-point-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[89-df-generated-submodel.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-algorithm.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-4.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-k.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-l-def.md]]\n[[89-df-